leios.theme.plymouth-theme (1.1.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Move the logo to the top of the screen and make the boot message box
    fill most of the screen below it (80 % of the width, down to 95 % of the
    height); it shows as many lines as fit instead of 8.
  * Wrap long boot messages at the edge of the box like the console does,
    instead of cutting them off.
  * While a password or question prompt is shown, shorten the message box so
    the prompt box fits below it.
  * Free the previous layout when the splash is shown again.

 -- Linus Fischer <leicraft@leicraftmc.de>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:34:23 +0100

